      "example_text": "Input: nums = [3,5,2,6], k = 2\nOutput: [2,6]\nExplanation: Among the set of every possible subsequence: {[3,5], [3,2], [3,6], [5,2], [5,6], [2,6]}, [2,6] is the most competitive.",
